[{"client_msg_id":"3e265994-b956-4c8c-a0f2-3d8736568ea6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"一旦 uintptr にすると何が発生するのかな","ts":"1620399594.417700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tbf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a781f75-9598-489f-83c5-3c20e227a4cf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと順序性って決ってるんですっけ?","ts":"1620399593.417600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+1g/D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11f8d849-350b-49f9-a934-20ba62d0d384","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"どうやってチェックしてるんだろこれ。","ts":"1620399587.417200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kiy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03ba0fab-f41c-41ce-ba56-c7d07c1fc8a3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"わからないですけど","ts":"1620399582.416900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5iGc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9d4d4fc-0250-40ad-b254-dafe1740fe85","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"同じアドレス値だとダメかもしれないですね","ts":"1620399580.416500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1vB8L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45aeba67-369f-4aa8-99d0-3d9aef8539e8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"う、うーむ","ts":"1620399563.415900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y9jx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04ab4fd4-b7ce-4c08-8948-4d9859213e90","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとはまあ...Goの構造体の先頭のメンバのアドレス引いて無理矢理渡す?","ts":"1620399555.415400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ka1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d658208-7a6d-450f-a554-942ad080b40b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"今回は透過的にやってほしいので許可して欲しい感じだった","ts":"1620399543.415200","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1620399555.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qJfd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9144b4ec-a942-4d51-833f-b688aaf4ed26","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"禁止するのはいいんですが","ts":"1620399535.414800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dhN0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9bdfdde-dd34-42c7-98e5-b70e58c6dd54","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"C から不用意にメンバに触ると GC の預かり知らぬところで破壊がおこなわれる危険性があるので","ts":"1620399531.414400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cOO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63360ce2-dd90-4b8a-8be5-c7eb76357799","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"はい","ts":"1620399505.413500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bvQR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"beac1e7a-4ea1-455c-862d-9286dfb44ecf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほどそこがネックなんですね","ts":"1620399463.413100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVqH9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"038439bc-8477-44bb-bfeb-6883921471f1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go の構造体ポインタで、メンバに Go のポインタが入ったりしていると怒られます","ts":"1620399414.412900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Zq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04450d31-4570-40ee-a28b-713e75eaee23","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go のポインタは unsafe.Pointer なら C の void* として渡せます","ts":"1620399393.412500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VqKNp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92f3310a-9017-45eb-9914-b33fbdc89e64","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いや、そもそもとしてどうやって渡すのかなーというレベルから気になったのと\n中にGoのポインタの定義があると生成できなくなったりするのかなという、発展的疑問がうかんだもので\n\n1. GoでC ABIなアドレスを出せるか(渡すことはできるとする)\n2. Goで構造体にGoのポインタがあってもその機能は制限されないか","ts":"1620399355.412000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bbH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7faf675c-b1ed-478e-a956-4d1bd7cfcdfb","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"といいますと?","ts":"1620399236.409900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pbJDl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc42ec4e-5195-457d-bcf6-beb8d97c374a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Goの構造体のポインタの導出をGo内でやる方法ありますっけ?","ts":"1620398912.409600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2ol"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eff22009-52d1-4670-8783-7f06c8b961e8","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"C の世界では構造体の中を見ないので、単に透過的にアドレス値として扱ってくれれば問題ないんですけど。","ts":"1620398403.409100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"udtS/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"669c7200-2c16-4d8c-98db-1724b5197582","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go のポインタを持つ Go 構造体へのポインタを C にわたすいい方法ないだろうか…","ts":"1620398349.408100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LSJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82ec5297-b7e5-4f61-a958-b8faef970127","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"```$ go vet -h\nusage: go vet [-n] [-x] [-vettool prog] [build flags] [vet flags] [packages]\nRun 'go help vet' for details.\nRun 'go tool vet help' for a full list of flags and analyzers.\nRun 'go tool vet -help' for an overview.```\nhelpちらばってるなあ。仕方ないのかもしれんけど...","ts":"1620393956.407600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L5Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6d2c705d-1dca-4e92-9343-78fe951f426c","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/golang/status/1390386424512499